of runs reach stable correct reversed specialization within the tested 200-step post-swap window.

PRIMARY CAUSAL-LOCK-IN NEGATIVE
A role that was useful yesterday can become:

SELF-REINFORCING IDENTITY.

Directly writing past causal success into:
fast role expression

can prevent adaptation when:
the metabolic niche reverses.

Thus:

CAUSAL CREDIT
SHOULD NOT DIRECTLY BECOME
PERMANENT ROLE IDENTITY.

